=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the door to {p:Prince Trion}'s room (Door: Prince Royal's Rm) at {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} (H-7) while you are a {p:Paladin} for a cutscene.
** If you were a {p:Paladin} when you completed the previous quest, {q:A Boy's Dream|A Boy's Dream|A Boy's Dream}, you have already received this cutscene. Check your active Quests and you should see "Under Oath".

!Castle Zvahl Baileys-map3.jpg|right|Coffer Locations are marked as red squares
* **The rest of this quest can be completed as any job from this point on.**
* Speak to {n:Vemalpeau}, {z:Southern San d'Oria} (M-7), inside a house.
* Speak to {n:Najjar}, {z:Southern San d'Oria} (K-6) inside the Lion Springs Tavern, who will mention ({p:Key Item}) {k:Mique's paintbrush}.
* Speak to {n:Ullasa}, {z:Southern San d'Oria} (B-6) inside the Count's Manor, who will mention ({p:Key Item}) {k:Mique's paintbrush}.
* Obtain a {i:Zvahl Coffer Key|Zvahl Coffer Key|1048} and trade it to a {p:Treasure Coffer} in {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} to get ({p:Key Item}) {k:Mique's paintbrush}.
** You can purchase a {i:Zvahl Coffer Key|Zvahl Coffer Key|1048} from the {p:Curio Vendor Moogle} for 5,000 gil if you have the {k:"Rhapsody in Umber"} KI.
*** Alternatively, {i:Zvahl Coffer Key|Zvahl Coffer Key|1048} drops off {p:Ahriman}, {m:Abyssal Demon}, {m:Arch Demon}, {m:Blood Demon}, and {m:Doom Demon}. You can also come as a {p:Thief} and pick the Coffer's lock with either {i:Thief's Tools|Thief's Tools|1022}, {i:Living Key|Living Key|1023}, or {i:Skeleton Key|Skeleton Key|1115}.
* Return to {n:Vemalpeau}.
* Head to the second story in {n:Vemalpeau}'s house and examine the **???** on the painting. Look behind the painting and read the letter for ({p:Key Item}) {k:Strange sheet of paper}.
* Speak to {p:Exoroche} (K-7) in Helbort's Blades who will tell you how to read the letter.
* Head to {z:Davoi} and locate the Village Well at (G-9).
* Examine the Village Well will spawn 2 NMs:
** {m:Three-eyed Prozpuz} ({p:RNG})
** {m:One-eyed Gwajboj} ({p:PLD})
*** Drops the {i:Well Weight|Well Weight|1095} you need to continue this quest.
*** Only one {i:Well Weight|Well Weight|1095} drops at a time. If you are doing this for several {p:Paladins|Paladin}, you will have to wait 3 minutes after defeating them to do the fight for each of them.
* Trade the {i:Well Weight|Well Weight|1095} to the Village Well for a cutscene and ({p:Key Item}) {k:Knight's confession}.
* Speak to {n:Ailbeche}, {z:Northern San d'Oria} (J-9).
* Travel to {z:Jugner Forest} and head for the **Maiden's Spring** at (E-6). When you get close to the spring, a cutscene will start.
* Head back to {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} and speak to {p:Prince Trion} for your reward.

=3 Optional component
* You may additionally talk to {n:Ailbeche}, {p:Exoroche}, and {n:Vemalpeau} for more quest-related dialogue.
** {n:Vemalpeau} will take your {k:Knight's confession} key item.

